### Suggested Enhancements:  
- Prioritize user authentication tasks, including registration and login, as foundational for enabling other functionalities. Follow this up with critical album management tasks.  
- Clarify the expected behaviors of user interactions within the application, outlining how features like liking and commenting on albums should work and what feedback users should receive upon taking actions.  
- Group related tasks logically by functionality, for example, assembling all user authentication tasks together and clustering UI-related tasks for streamlined implementation and discussion.  
- Include tasks for handling edge cases and invalid submissions to enhance application robustness and improve user experience across various interactions.  
- Consider adding tasks to define user interaction data structures, such as those related to likes and comments, to ensure they are incorporated effectively later in development.
